and-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Changed from scope:local (project mails) to scope:user on 2026-07-10 so its 67 agents/92 commands/277 skills load in every project; required a Claude Code restart to take effect. A caveat found by verification: ecc:deep-research needs firecrawl+exa MCPs which aren't connected, so the built-in deep-research skill is used instead for Chain C."}, {"id": "docs_command_library_chaining_rules", "label": "Chaining rules (\u00a77)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/command-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Orchestrator stays clean: a workflow script/orchestrator must not read artifacts it spawns agents to produce, to avoid context overflow \u2014 it dispatches, collects structured results, and synthesizes."}, {"id": "docs_command_library_legacy_skills_removal", "label": "Removed legacy user-level skills (\u00a76)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/command-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "~90 skills in ~/.claude/skills/ were deleted on 2026-07-10 because they referenced agent types (sdd:*, sadd:*, superpowers:*) from plugins that were never installed, breaking at subagent spawn; the library now builds on ecc + built-ins instead."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_command_library", "target": "docs_ecc_catalog", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/command-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_command_library", "target": "docs_ecc_cmd_agents", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/command-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_command_library", "target